#: ../../talk/messages.rst:3
msgid "Interacting with messages"
msgstr "Idirghníomhú le teachtaireachtaí"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:6
msgid "Editing messages"
msgstr "Teachtaireachtaí á n-eagarthóireacht"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:8
msgid ""
"You can edit messages and captions to file shares up to 6 hours after "
"sending."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat teachtaireachtaí agus fotheidil a chur in eagar le haghaidh "
"comhroinnte comhad suas le 6 huaire an chloig tar éis iad a sheoladh."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:10
msgid "Talk chat view showing the edit option on a message"
msgstr ""
"Radharc comhrá a thaispeánann an rogha eagarthóireachta ar theachtaireacht"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:15
msgid "Pinning messages"
msgstr "Teachtaireachtaí á bpriontáil"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:17
msgid ""
"A moderator can pin important messages in a conversation, for a certain "
"period of time or until it's no longer relevant."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le modhnóir teachtaireachtaí tábhachtacha a phionáil i gcomhrá, ar"
" feadh tréimhse áirithe ama nó go dtí nach bhfuil sé ábhartha a thuilleadh."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:19
msgid "Talk message context menu with pin message option"
msgstr ""
"Roghchlár comhthéacs do theachtaireacht chomhrá, leis an rogha "
"teachtaireacht a phionnadh"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:23
msgid ""
"Pinned messages are highlighted and accessible above the chat or in the "
"``Shared items`` tab of the content sidebar. If you no longer need a pinned "
"message, you can unpin it for everyone or only yourself from quick actions."
msgstr ""
"Tá teachtaireachtaí bioráilte aibhsithe agus inrochtana os cionn an chomhrá "
"nó sa chluaisín ``Míreanna Comhroinnte`` den bharra taoibh ábhair. Mura "
"bhfuil teachtaireacht bioráilte uait a thuilleadh, is féidir leat í a "
"dhíbhioráil do gach duine nó duit féin amháin ó ghníomhartha tapa."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:25
msgid ""
"Talk chat view with a pinned message highlighted above the conversation"
msgstr ""
"Amharc comhrá ina bhfuil teachtaireacht bhioraithe aibhsithe os cionn an "
"chomhrá"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:30
msgid "Setting reminder on messages"
msgstr "Meabhrúchán a shocrú ar theachtaireachtaí"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:32
msgid ""
"You can set reminders on specific messages. If there's an important message "
"you want to be notified about later, simply hover over it and click on the "
"reminder icon."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat meabhrúcháin a shocrú ar theachtaireachtaí sonracha. Más ann "
"do theachtaireacht thábhachtach ar mhaith leat fógra a fháil fúithi níos "
"déanaí, níl le déanamh ach an luchóg a chur os a cionn agus cliceáil ar "
"dheilbhín an mheabhrúcháin."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:34
msgid "Talk message context menu showing the set reminder option"
msgstr ""
"Roghchlár comhthéacs teachtaireachta comhrá a thaispeánann an rogha "
"meabhrúcháin socraithe"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:38
msgid ""
"In the submenu, you can select an appropriate time to receive a notification"
" later."
msgstr ""
"Sa fho-roghchlár, is féidir leat am oiriúnach a roghnú chun fógra a fháil "
"níos déanaí."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:40
msgid "Talk reminder time selection submenu for a message"
msgstr ""
"Fo-roghchlár chun am meabhrúcháin a roghnú le haghaidh teachtaireachta"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:44
msgid ""
"You can also forward a message to another conversation using the ``...`` "
"menu, or send it to your **Note to self** conversation for personal "
"reference."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat teachtaireacht a chur ar aghaidh chuig comhrá eile freisin ag"
" baint úsáide as an roghchlár ``...``, nó í a sheoladh chuig do chomhrá "
"**Nóta chugam féin** le haghaidh tagartha pearsanta."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:47
msgid "Messages search in a conversation"
msgstr "Cuardach teachtaireachtaí i gcomhrá"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:49
msgid ""
"In addition to global unified search, you can search for messages within a "
"specific conversation. In the content sidebar of a conversation, click the "
"search icon to open the search tab."
msgstr ""
"Chomh maith le cuardach aontaithe domhanda, is féidir leat cuardach a "
"dhéanamh ar theachtaireachtaí laistigh de chomhrá ar leith. I mbarra taoibh "
"ábhair comhrá, cliceáil ar an deilbhín cuardaigh chun an cluaisín cuardaigh "
"a oscailt."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:51
msgid "Talk in-conversation message search field"
msgstr "Réimse cuardaigh teachtaireachtaí laistigh de chomhrá"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:55
msgid ""
"You can narrow down your search by using filters such as date range, and "
"sender."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat do chuardach a chúngú trí scagairí amhail raon dáta agus "
"seoltóir a úsáid."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:57
msgid "Talk message search with date range and sender filter options"
msgstr ""
"Cuardach teachtaireachtaí comhrá le roghanna maidir le raon dátaí agus "
"scagaire seoltóra"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:62
msgid "Threaded messages"
msgstr "Teachtaireachtaí snáithithe"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:64
msgid ""
"You can create threads in conversations to keep discussions organized. The "
"thread creation option is available in the new message additional actions."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat snáitheanna a chruthú i gcomhráite chun plé a choinneáil "
"eagraithe. Tá an rogha cruthú snáithe ar fáil sna gníomhartha breise "
"teachtaireachta nua."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:66
msgid "Talk message context menu showing the create thread option"
msgstr ""
"Roghchlár comhthéacs teachtaireachta comhrá ina dtaispeántar an rogha chun "
"snáithe a chruthú"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:70
msgid ""
"Then, you can add a title and description for the thread and start the "
"discussion."
msgstr ""
"Ansin, is féidir leat teideal agus cur síos a chur leis an snáithe agus an "
"plé a thosú."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:72
msgid "Talk thread creation dialog with title and description fields"
msgstr ""
"Dialóg chun snáithe cainte a chruthú, ina bhfuil réimsí don teideal agus don"
" chur síos"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:76
msgid ""
"You can view all replies in a thread either from the replies button on the "
"message or from ``Shared items`` tab in the content sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat na freagraí go léir i snáithe a fheiceáil ón gcnaipe freagraí"
" ar an teachtaireacht nó ón táb ``Míreanna comhroinnte`` sa bharra taoibh "
"ábhair."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:78
msgid "Talk shared items sidebar panel listing conversation threads"
msgstr ""
"Painéal taoibh do mhíreanna comhroinnte ina liostaítear snáitheanna comhrá"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:82
msgid ""
"You can subscribe to a thread to receive notifications about new replies. It"
" is possible to subscribe from the thread itself or from the sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat liostáil le snáithe chun fógraí a fháil faoi fhreagraí nua. "
"Is féidir liostáil ón snáithe féin nó ón mbarra taoibh."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:84
msgid "Talk thread with notification subscription toggle"
msgstr "Snáithe cainte le lasc chun síntiús a fháil le fógraí"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:88
msgid ""
"Subscribed threads are easily accessible from the navigation bar in "
"``Threads`` navigation."
msgstr ""
"Is furasta rochtain a fháil ar shnáitheanna suibscríofa ón mbarra "
"nascleanúna sa nascleanúint ``Snáitheanna``."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:90
msgid "Talk navigation bar Threads section showing followed threads"
msgstr ""
"Barra nascleanúna an phlé – rannán na snáitheanna ina dtaispeántar na "
"snáitheanna a leantar"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:94
msgid ""
"You can edit the thread title from the thread itself or from the sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat teideal an snáithe a chur in eagar ón snáithe féin nó ón "
"mbarra taoibh."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:96
msgid "Talk thread title edit option in the thread header"
msgstr ""
"Rogha chun teideal snáithe plé a chur in eagar i gceanntásc an tsnáithe"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:101
msgid "Private replies"
msgstr "Freagraí príobháideacha"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:103
msgid ""
"Private replies are messages that are forwarded directly to a one-to-one "
"conversation between you and specific message author, to maintain privacy "
"where it's needed."
msgstr ""
"Is teachtaireachtaí iad freagraí príobháideacha a sheoltar go díreach chuig "
"comhrá duine-le-duine idir tusa agus údar ar leith teachtaireachta, chun "
"príobháideachas a chaomhnú nuair is gá."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:105
msgid ""
"In group and public conversations, select a message you want to reply to "
"privately"
msgstr ""
"I gcomhráite grúpa agus poiblí, roghnaigh teachtaireacht ar mhaith leat "
"freagra a thabhairt uirthi go príobháideach."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:106
msgid "In message actions, select ``Reply privately``"
msgstr ""
"I ngníomhartha teachtaireachta, roghnaigh ``Freagair go príobháideach``"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:107
msgid ""
"A one-to-one conversation window opens with the original message quoted"
msgstr ""
"Osclaítear fuinneog comhrá duine-le-duine, agus an buntheachtaireacht luaite"
" inti."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:108
msgid "Add your response and send a message"
msgstr "Cuir do fhreagra leis agus seol teachtaireacht"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:110
msgid ""
"The reply provides a full context of a quoted message — including the "
"original sender's name, original conversation context, and backlink."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann an freagra comhthéacs iomlán ar fáil do theachtaireacht a luadh — "
"lena n-áirítear ainm an tseoltóra bhunaidh, comhthéacs an chomhrá bhunaidh, "
"agus nasc siar."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:112
msgid "Talk 1-1 conversation with private reply"
msgstr "Comhrá duine le duine le freagra príobháideach"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:117
msgid "Message reactions"
msgstr "Imoibrithe le teachtaireachtaí"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:119
msgid ""
"Add emoji reactions to messages to quickly express agreement, celebrate, or "
"indicate emotions without typing full responses."
msgstr ""
"Cuir frithghníomhartha emoji le teachtaireachtaí chun aontú a chur in iúl go"
" tapa, chun ceiliúradh a dhéanamh, nó chun mothúcháin a léiriú, gan freagraí"
" iomlána a chlóscríobh."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:121
msgid "Hover over a message in the chat"
msgstr "Bog an cúrsóir thar theachtaireacht sa chomhrá"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:122
msgid "Click the ``Add reaction`` button from message actions"
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar an gcnaipe ``Cuir imoibriú leis`` i measc gníomhartha "
"teachtaireachta"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:123
msgid "Select an emoji from the list of frequently used or full picker"
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh emoji ó liosta na cinn a úsáidtear go minic, nó ón roghnóir iomlán"

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:125
msgid ""
"You can hover over a reaction to see other users who reacted with it. Click "
"one of the existing reactions to react with the same emoji! You can click it"
" again to remove your reaction from the message."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat an cúrsóir a choinneáil os cionn imoibrithe chun a fheiceáil "
"cé na húsáideoirí eile a d’úsáid an t-imoibriú sin. Cliceáil ar cheann de na"
" himoibrithe atá ann cheana chun an emoji céanna a úsáid mar imoibriú! Is "
"féidir leat cliceáil air arís chun d’imoibriú a bhaint den teachtaireacht."

#: ../../talk/messages.rst:128
msgid "Talk message with reactions"
msgstr "Teachtaireacht chomhrá le frithghníomhartha"
